T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Guided Media \(Conducted physical waves\):) Tj
T*
(- Twisted Pair Cable: Pairs of copper wires twisted to cancel electromagnetic) Tj
T*
(interference \(EMI\). Unshielded Twisted Pair \(UTP Cat6: up to 10 Gbps at 55 m\) and) Tj
T*
(Shielded Twisted Pair \(STP\). RJ-45 connector.) Tj
T*
(- Coaxial Cable: Central copper core, insulating dielectric, woven copper braid, outer) Tj
T*
(plastic jacket. BNC connector.) Tj
T*
(- Fiber Optic Cable: Core and cladding transmitting light pulses via Total Internal) Tj
T*
(Reflection \(TIR\). Immune to EMI; immense bandwidth. Single-mode \(long distance laser\) vs) Tj
T*
(Multimode \(short distance LED\).) Tj
T*
(* Unguided Media \(Wireless electromagnetic broadcast\): Radio waves \(omnidirectional,) Tj
T*
(penetrate walls\), Microwaves \(line-of-sight parabolic antennas\), Infrared) Tj
T*
(\(short-range, blocked by walls\).) Tj
T*
